    "body": "I asked @mstensho and @rune-opera about this, and didn't have strong opinions and said it would be easy to fix; the concern would be web compat.\r\n\r\nI did a query in httparchive to try to find some affected URLs\r\n```\r\nSELECT * FROM (\r\nSELECT page, url, REGEXP_EXTRACT(LOWER(body), r'<[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*\\s(?:[^>]+\\s)?dir\\s*=\\s*(?:[\"\\']?([^\"\\'>\\s\\\\\\{\\+]+))') AS match\r\nFROM [httparchive:har.2017_05_15_chrome_requests_bodies]\r\n) WHERE RIGHT(url, 3) != \".js\"\r\nAND match != \"null\"\r\nAND match != \"ltr\"\r\nAND match != \"rtl\"\r\nAND match != \"auto\"\r\n```\r\nResults at https://gist.github.com/zcorpan/0a4a6afdbc26d0ee2a98daaf3e87cbd3 (haven't yet looked into these, but likely most are false positives).",
