    "created_at": "2017-10-09T15:10:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-10-09T15:10:08Z",
    "body": "Oh, and I guess there are two possible directions we could go here.  We could change UAs to comply with the spec, or we could change the spec.  Based on above it sounded like the former should be doable in this case, but I would really to have some sort of commitment from Blink and WebKit before changing Gecko here...",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
