    "created_at": "2019-04-09T21:52:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-04-09T21:52:15Z",
    "body": "Agree with @r12a, it makes sense to just use `[dir] { unicode-bidi: isolate; }` as Mozilla has done. I would recommend aligning the spec on this point. If Mozilla is shipping this, there shouldn't be significant Web-compat problems (and it would only affect invalid values anyway), and as @r12a mentions, it might even be more likely to fix things than break them.",
