    "created_at": "2019-04-12T02:08:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-04-12T02:08:53Z",
    "body": "FWIW, the fact we use `embed` instead of `isolate` is probably more of an oversight than a deliberate choice. I think we'd be open to change WebKit's behavior but only if it's compatible with existing contents. The fact Chrome & Gecko's behavior matches is encouraging but we may have some iOS / macOS specific content out there so we'd have to test & see.",
